    "text": "Your baby is figuring out one of the biggest ideas there is: the world keeps going when they can't see it. Every round of peekaboo, every dropped spoon, every toy found under a cloth adds to it.\n\nIn the next lesson, our last, we'll look at what the research says about screens for babies, and then step back to see the whole first year together. I'll see you there."
